---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import logoSquare from '../../assets/brand/zenkai-logo-square.png';
---
<section class="py-28 lg:py-36 border-t border-zk-border/50 relative overflow-hidden">

  <div class="orb orb-1" style="opacity: 0.3"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 spotlight pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8 text-center reveal">
    <Image
      src={logoSquare}
      alt="ZENKAI"
      width={64}
      height={64}
      format="webp"
      class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-8 rounded-2xl object-cover ring-2 ring-zk-border shadow-2xl shadow-zk-accent/30"
    />

    <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-6">
      Lo peor que puede pasar es<br>
      <span class="gradient-text">ahorrarte una semana de llamadas.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zk-text2 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Prueba la propuesta gratis. Si te sirve, hablamos. Si no, te quedas con un plan de acción concreto. <strong class="text-zk-text">No hay forma de perder.</strong>
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mb-7">
      <a href="#hero-demo" class="btn-primary text-white font-semibold text-base px-8 py-4 rounded-xl inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
        <span>Generar mi propuesta en 30 segundos</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-zk-muted">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zk-success rounded-full"></span> Gratis · sin tarjeta</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zk-success rounded-full"></span> Sin email para ver</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-zk-success rounded-full"></span> Sin agendar nada</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
